{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"chi squared profile distance chi squared profile distance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","fileName":"Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Chi-Squared Profile Distance","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 10:01\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Correspondence Analysis and Narrative Geometry]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Correspondence Analysis and Narrative Geometry","datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"chi squared profile distance chi squared profile distance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","fileName":"Chi-Squared Profile Distance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Chi-Squared Profile Distance","heading":"Chi-Squared Profile Distance","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A profile divides a row's occurrence counts by that row's total, so long and short texts can be compared by their relative word usage. Correspondence analysis weights the squared difference between two row profiles by the inverse mass of each column. A difference on a rare attribute therefore contributes more than an equal difference on a common one.\n\nThis chi-squared distance is appropriate to the frequency table that begins the analysis. The complete factor-space representation preserves it as Euclidean distance, making otherwise awkward weighted relationships easier to inspect and cluster.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Correspondence Analysis and Narrative Geomet